"Community Heritage Lead"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Evolve and stay relevant, 2035–2046"},{"type":"p","text":"Museum professionals increasingly need to combine curatorial expertise with digital collections, 3D documentation, immersive interpretation, accessibility, data management and audience analytics. AI can assist with cataloguing, research discovery and multilingual interpretation, but provenance, scholarly judgement, ethics and cultural sensitivity remain human-led responsibilities."}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Government and cultural institutions"},{"type":"table","header":["Organisation","Relevant exposure"],"rows":[[{"text":"Ministry of Culture","url":"https://www.indiaculture.gov.in/"},{"text":"Cultural institutions and heritage programmes"}],[{"text":"National Museum","url":"https://nationalmuseumindia.gov.in/"},{"text":"Collections, exhibitions and museum research"}],[{"text":"Archaeological Survey of India","url":"https://asi.nic.in/"},{"text":"Archaeology and cultural heritage"}],[{"text":"National Gallery of Modern Art","url":"https://ngmaindia.gov.in/"},{"text":"Modern/contemporary art collections"}],[{"text":"Indian Council of Historical Research","url":"https://ichr.ac.in/"},{"text":"Historical research"}],[{"text":"Sangeet Natak Akademi","url":"https://sangeetnatak.gov.in/"},{"text":"Performing-arts heritage"}],[{"text":"INTACH","url":"https://intach.org/"},{"text":"Heritage documentation and conservation"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Museum internship targets"},{"type":"p","text":"Look for opportunities in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Collection documentation"},{"text":"Curatorial research"},{"text":"Archives"},{"text":"Conservation"},{"text":"Exhibition development"},{"text":"Museum education"},{"text":"Visitor research"},{"text":"Digital collections"},{"text":"Heritage documentation"},{"text":"Cultural programming"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Also target university museums, state museums, city museu